2.5. A default shall be cured when the City shall have satisfied applicable provisions for cure
in the Note, the Loan Agreement, and all other applicable Loan Documents.
3. Termination.  Upon satisfaction in full of the Obligations, this Assignment shall thereupon be
void and of further no effect and, in that event, upon the City’s request, the Council agrees to
execute and deliver to the City instruments evidencing the termination of this Assignment
and/or release of the Council’s interest in the Easement, the Rail Easement Agreement, and
the Track Lease.
4. Notice.  Notice and other communications under this Assignment shall be given in the same
manner provided for in the Note.
5. Miscellaneous.  The provisions of Section 14 of the Loan Agreement and all of the subsec-
tions thereunder are hereby incorporated herein by this reference.
